Wait, actually, let me reconsider. Let me look at the flow after `make_chain`:

```c
if (chain != NULL) {
    if (_chain_len != 1) {
        ret = GNUTLS_E_REQUESTED_DATA_NOT_AVAILABLE;
        goto done;
    }
    ret = make_chain(&_chain, &_chain_len, &_extra_certs, &_extra_certs_len, flags);
